<title>UK: U.S. stocks mixed in London, Digital up $3/8.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks mixed in London, Digital up $3/8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks were mixed in thin trading in London on Friday, as many European investors moved to the sidelines ahead of next week's Federal Reserve Open Market Committee (FOMC) meeting, dealers said.</p>
<p>A Wall Street Journal report that said Intel Corp and Digital Equipment Corp were seeking to settle Digital's patent-infringement lawsuit against Intel enlivened otherwise dull trading, dealers said.</p>
</text>
